    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Value-type handle for a Raft snapshot created by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_i_raft_snapshot_manager" kindref="compound">IRaftSnapshotManager</ref>.</para>
<para><ref refid="structthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_snapshot_handle_1a65afc266f9828432854ed2259f9765ce" kindref="member">verifyIntegrity()</ref> performs an HMAC-SHA-256 check over the snapshot content before any compactLog() call may proceed; tampered snapshots are rejected. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
